    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307120/extras/e88ffa0a33fb1295e56d3127732bf5dd.avif?t=1754644871\" data-has-big width=800 height=506 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It's time to make love happen, again!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Kitty Powers\u2019 Matchmaker: Makeover, players step back into the role of a matchmaking agency manager, helping quirky clients find their true love under the expert guidance of the fabulous Kitty Powers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This remastered version comes bursting with vibrant new artwork, expanded customization options, and a host of gameplay improvements to make matchmaking even more fun and inclusive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced Artwork: Feast your eyes on Matchmaker\u2019s enhanced assets and sumptuously high definition artwork. Now with 4K and ultra-widescreen modes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Expanded Customization: Players have new options to dress and style their characters, with updated personalities and fashion that ensures anything goes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Gameplay Elements: Flex your matchmaking muscles with new dating dilemmas, improved mechanics, and refined controls that make it easier to create perfect matches.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307120/extras/e88ffa0a33fb1295e56d3127732bf5dd.avif?t=1754644871\" data-has-big width=800 height=506 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It's time to make love happen, again!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Kitty Powers\u2019 Matchmaker: Makeover, players step back into the role of a matchmaking agency manager, helping quirky clients find their true love under the expert guidance of the fabulous Kitty Powers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This remastered version comes bursting with vibrant new artwork, expanded customization options, and a host of gameplay improvements to make matchmaking even more fun and inclusive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced Artwork: Feast your eyes on Matchmaker\u2019s enhanced assets and sumptuously high definition artwork. Now with 4K and ultra-widescreen modes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Expanded Customization: Players have new options to dress and style their characters, with updated personalities and fashion that ensures anything goes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Gameplay Elements: Flex your matchmaking muscles with new dating dilemmas, improved mechanics, and refined controls that make it easier to create perfect matches.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
